& [CanonicalRecord: IR3FinalSlices] is the processed planning authority for IR3 final work slices
  + [canonical_uuid] is 62aded9b-cbe4-4c41-bbed-1170780d9bbc
  + [source_manifest_uuid] is 8bf3992d-5ec0-4d6d-abe3-a4d384a24500
  + [slice_surface_uuid] is a29a9777-f8fb-42d8-8290-ec123f9085e2
  + [authority_scope] is IR3 slice order, gates, expected outputs, model routing, implementation boundaries, fixture runner policy, trace output policy, and forbidden downstream scope
  + [implementation_scope] is operator harness and fixture runner planning plus gated implementation activation
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/IR2_Parser_Projection_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/reviews/IR2_Implementation_Completion_Review.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/FSC2_Planning_Coordination_Pack.v1.sop

  = must: use docs/slices/IR3_Final_Slices.v1.sop as the current IR3 slice surface
  = must: execute IR3-S01 first
  = must: run completion review after each IR3 slice before opening the next gated slice
  = must: preserve generated traces and fixture outputs as non-authoritative projections
  - never: treat IR3 slices as permission for live dispatch, LangGraph runtime implementation, operations control, or live machine control

& [CanonicalIR3SliceSet] is the final IR3 slice sequence
  + [slice] is IR3-S01 operator harness boundary and invariant map
  + [slice] is IR3-S02 contract-driven operator runner and trace contract
  + [slice] is IR3-S03 fixture runner input/output policy and generated trace boundary
  + [slice] is IR3-S04 implementation file inventory and activation plan
  + [slice] is IR3-S05 operator harness fixture and expected trace ledger plan
  + [slice] is IR3-S06 IR3 completion review and implementation activation pack

  = must: preserve this order unless completion review rebakes IR3

& [CanonicalIR3ExecutionGate] is the activation rule for IR3
  + [current_ready_slice] is IR3-S01
  + [gated_slice] is IR3-S02 until IR3-S01 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is IR3-S03 until IR3-S02 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is IR3-S04 until IR3-S03 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is IR3-S05 until IR3-S04 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is IR3-S06 until IR3-S05 accepted
  + [completion_gate] is IR3 implementation activation pack accepted after IR3-S06

& [CanonicalIR3ModelRouting] is the model-routing record
  + [IR3-S01] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [IR3-S02] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [IR3-S03] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [IR3-S04] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [IR3-S05] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable after IR3-S01 through IR3-S04 are accepted and fixture scope is bounded
  + [IR3-S06] is requires deeper reasoning

  = must: keep operator authority boundaries, trace semantics, fixture runner policy, and final activation under deeper reasoning

